  Intentionally empty hardened-runtime entitlement set.

  Standard WKWebView JavaScript executes in Apple's separately signed WebKit
  content process; the Moosewave executable does not JIT or map unsigned
  executable memory. Network access also needs no entitlement for the current
  direct Developer ID distribution because App Sandbox is not enabled.

  Do not add allow-jit, allow-unsigned-executable-memory, disable-library-
  validation, or an explicit app-sandbox=false exception. A future Mac App
  Store build requires a separate sandbox design and test matrix.
-->
